code.description:
Code classifies the failure: not_found (the item does not exist or is
in Trash), invalid (the change does not pass the item's validation;
Error says why) or failed (anything else).

current_price.description:
CurrentPrice is the current value in the group currency, null when
unknown. When known, 0 included, it is the item's value in every total;
otherwise the purchase price in the group currency stands in.
